          "title": "Motor Vehicle Fatality Form",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "10867599-c830-49fc-8bff-52956e3165d6",
              "content": "<p>New feedback identified several changes needed:</p><ul><li>Add collision options included in the latest tracking spreadsheet, such as Vehicle vs. Bicycle.</li><li>Add an Unknown option to several fields.</li><li>Support multiple involved people, such as multiple deceased or at-fault parties.</li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
