    {
      "id": "c7b00f6d-0e2a-4ce0-801c-db14162e0887",
      "title": "Integrations/Conversions",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "1a92e5c9-d2f0-40bf-bacc-c84549aa4a7a",
          "title": "Warrants",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "b9f273f7-8f7a-4bb4-8ae1-7355b192f624",
              "content": "<p><strong>Issues:</strong> Integration Ticket entered for issues below</p><ul><li>A warrant did not reactivate despite having the same docket number and subject. Differences included the case-number format and the incoming felony charge versus the corrected misdemeanor charge on the existing warrant.</li><li>Certain charges coming as the correct charge but with DV incorrectly</li><li>Shoplifting charges coming in as felony version instead of misdemeanor</li><li>13-1203A1(M1)(DV) coming in as 13-1203A1 (M2)</li></ul>"
            },
            {
              "id": "21534bd1-e829-4fdc-a1b0-4b663a6c891a",
              "content": "<p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Records specialist updates warrant to correct charge</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e7165f9d-3107-4a90-8a22-093a14de9191",
          "title": "Tech 5",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "0836c60f-437d-4084-aee0-029e93540d4f",
              "content": "<p>Export to Axon disabled</p><ul><li>On July 23, Tech 5 confirmed that the export to Axon had been disabled in its configuration.</li><li>This stops Tech 5 from sending data to the Axon Records API while the agency is not live with the integration.</li></ul>"
            },
            {
              "id": "b94b32bf-b8e7-4e34-89d3-9a1e62bf34b7",
              "content": "<p>Outstanding: Tech 5 change in endpoint configuration: we export to Tech 5.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "e912b7a2-9a64-41ea-9d00-bbb3230394ed",
              "content": "<p>Outstanding: Pending on confirmation Tech 5 only sends offenders and not civilian fingerprints</p>"
            },
